>\r\n<div class=\"md:w-1/2 text-center md:text-left\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold mb-4\">AC Emergency? We&#8217;re on Our Way!</h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-lg mb-6\">For those unexpected breakdowns, our <strong>24 hour AC repair Vadodara</strong> team is always on standby. Don&#8217;t suffer in the heat—call us anytime for immediate assistance. We prioritize emergency calls to restore your comfort as quickly as possible.</p>\r\n<a class=\"bg-white text-red-600 font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg cta-button text-xl\" href=\"tel:+919876543210\" aria-label=\"Call now for emergency AC repair\"> <i class=\"fas fa-phone-volume mr-2\"></i> Call for Immediate Help </a></div>\r\n<div class=\"md:w-1/2\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"rounded-lg shadow-2xl\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/emergency-ac-repair-in-vadodara.webp\" alt=\"24/7 Emergency AC Repair in Vadodara\" title=\"\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<!-- Customer Testimonials -->\r\n<section id=\"testimonials\" class=\"py-16 bg-white\">\r\n<div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center mb-12\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900\">What Our Vadodara Customers Say</h2>\r\n<p class=\"max-w-2xl mx-auto text-gray-600 mt-4\">Our 4.9-star rating on Google is a testament to our commitment to quality.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\">\r\n<div class=\"bg-gray-100 p-6 rounded-lg\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"text-yellow-400\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 italic mb-4\">&#8220;Atlas Aircon&#8217;s team was professional and fixed my AC in Manjalpur within hours. Highly recommend this <strong>AC service center in Vadodara</strong>!&#8221;</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-bold\">&#8211; Priya S., Manjalpur</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"bg-gray-100 p-6 rounded-lg\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"text-yellow-400\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 italic mb-4\">&#8220;The best <strong>air conditioner repair Vadodara</strong> has to offer. They explained the issue clearly and their pricing was very fair. My go-to for AC issues.&#8221;</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-bold\">&#8211; Ankit P., Alkapuri</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"bg-gray-100 p-6 rounded-lg\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center mb-4\">\r\n<div class=\"text-yellow-400\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 italic mb-4\">&#8220;I opted for their annual <strong>AC maintenance Gujarat</strong> plan. The pre-summer service was thorough and my AC has been working flawlessly.&#8221;</p>\r\n<p class=\"font-bold\">&#8211; Sameer K., Gotri</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"text-center mt-12\"><a class=\"bg-yellow-500 text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg cta-button\" href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=Atlas+Aircon+Vadodara\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Leave a review on Google My Business\"> <i class=\"fab fa-google mr-2\"></i> Leave a Review on Google </a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<!-- FAQ Section -->\r\n<section id=\"faq\" class=\"py-16 bg-gray-50\">\r\n<div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 max-w-4xl\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center mb-12\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\r\n<p class=\"max-w-2xl mx-auto text-gray-600 mt-4\">Got questions? We have answers. Optimized for your voice search queries.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"space-y-4\"><details class=\"group bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm\">\r\n<summary class=\"flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer font-semibold text-lg\">How often should my AC be serviced in Vadodara&#8217;s climate? <i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform\"></i></summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600\"><strong>Definitive Answer:</strong> For optimal performance in Vadodara&#8217;s hot and humid climate, we strongly recommend servicing your AC <strong>at least twice a year</strong>. Once before the peak summer season (March-April) and once after the monsoon season (October-November) to clean out moisture and dust buildup, which is crucial for <strong>AC maintenance in Gujarat</strong>.</p>\r\n</details><details class=\"group bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm\">\r\n<summary class=\"flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer font-semibold text-lg\">What are the signs my AC needs repair? <i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform\"></i></summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600\"><strong>Key Signs Your AC Needs Repair:</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"list-disc list-inside mt-2 space-y-1\">\r\n<li><strong>Reduced Cooling:</strong> The AC runs, but the room doesn&#8217;t get cold.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Strange Noises:</strong> Grinding, squealing, or rattling sounds.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Water Leakage:</strong> Puddles of water forming inside or outside the unit.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Bad Odors:</strong> A musty or burning smell from the vents.</li>\r\n<li><strong>High Electricity Bills:</strong> A sudden, unexplained spike in your power bill.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600\">If you notice any of these, it&#8217;s time to call an <strong>AC service center in Vadodara</strong>.</p>\r\n</details><details class=\"group bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm\">\r\n<summary class=\"flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer font-semibold text-lg\">Why is monsoon AC maintenance important in Gujarat? <i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform\"></i></summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600\">During Gujarat&#8217;s monsoon, high humidity can lead to fungal and bacterial growth inside your AC&#8217;s damp coils. This not only reduces cooling efficiency but also poses health risks. A post-monsoon service cleans and sanitizes the unit, preventing corrosion and ensuring healthy air circulation.</p>\r\n</details><details class=\"group bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm\">\r\n<summary class=\"flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer font-semibold text-lg\">What brands do you service? <i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform\"></i></summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600\">We service all major AC brands, including but not limited to Daikin, LG, Voltas, Samsung, Hitachi, Carrier, Blue Star, and O General. Our technicians are trained for all types, including <strong>split AC</strong>, window AC, and <strong>ductless AC</strong> systems.</p>\r\n</details><details class=\"group bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm\">\r\n<summary class=\"flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer font-semibold text-lg\">How quickly can a technician reach me for an emergency repair? <i class=\"fas fa-chevron-down group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform\"></i></summary>\r\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600\">For emergency calls within Vadodara city limits, our goal is to have a technician at your doorstep within 60-90 minutes. Our strategically located teams ensure we are the fastest &#8216;<strong>split AC repair near me</strong>&#8216;.</p>\r\n</details></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</main><!-- Popup Container -->\r\n<div id=\"quote-popup-overlay\">\r\n<div id=\"quote-popup-content\" class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-lg shadow-2xl max-w-sm w-full relative\"><button id=\"close-popup\" class=\"absolute top-2 right-3 text-2xl text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-800\" aria-label=\"Close quote form\">×</button>\r\n<h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-center mb-4\">Get a Free Quote!</h3>\r\n<p class=\"text-center text-gray-600 mb-6\">AC trouble? Get a fast, free estimate now.</p>\r\n<form>\r\n<div class=\"mb-4\"><label class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\" for=\"popup-name\">Name</label> <input id=\"popup-name\" class=\"mt-1 block w-full px-3 py-2 bg-white border border-gray-300 rounded-md shadow-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-blue-500 focus:border-blue-500\" required=\"\" type=\"text\